: start
: Test starting a program that is found in PATH
:
{
  $* sh -c 'touch ran' >'no children' &?ran

  # The program runs on its own, so give it some time to get there.
  #
  i = [uint64] 0
  while ($i != 10 && !$file_exists($~/ran))
  {
    sleep 1
    i += 1
  }

  test -f ran
}

: missing
: Test starting a program that does not exist
:
$* no-such-program 2>>~/EOE/ >'no children' != 0
  /error: unable to execute no-such-program: .+/
  EOE
